{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/reviews/layout,_N_T_/reviews/page,_N_T_/reviews"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--D8O5FRMMvIjTCrxW8kMaC--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/7d6937842080f396.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/0610f662fb4f8aec.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-c382ed19c2311dcb.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-62902f04efbdd792.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f10ca8562d68747b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/356-ba125e9f1b9f7c55.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-2bdc083cbf7c6af6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/page-44b8c3991ffaadf0.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Reviews | Lathrop Team | Lathrop Team</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn about the 525+ five-star reviews shared by buyers and sellers who have worked with the Lathrop Team in the Fox Cities.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"boot-screen\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"boot-screen-frame\"></div><div class=\"boot-screen-content\"><p class=\"boot-screen-message\">You&#x27;re at the perfect place for<span>Fox Cities real estate talk!</span></p></div><span class=\"boot-screen-index\">Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link site-nav-mobile-link--active\" href=\"/reviews\"><span>Reviews</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>07</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>08</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"editorial-page page-reviews\"><section class=\"editorial-hero reviews-hero\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">07</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Client feedback</p></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"editorial-hero-title\">Trust is built<em>one move at a time.</em></h1></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-hero-description\">More than 525 five-star reviews reflect the relationships the Lathrop Team has built with buyers and sellers throughout the Fox Cities.</p></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation</a></div></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-footnote\"><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span class=\"editorial-hero-footnote-line\"></span><span>525+ five-star reviews</span></div></section><section class=\"reviews-intro\"><div class=\"reviews-intro-aside\"><span class=\"editorial-section-number\">01 — The experience</span><span class=\"reviews-intro-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><div class=\"reviews-intro-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>A record of trust</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">The work matters.<em>So does how it feels.</em></h2></div><div class=\"reviews-intro-copy\"><p>Over the years, clients have shared more than 525 five-star reviews on platforms including Zillow and Google. That feedback reflects the care, preparation, and communication we bring to every transaction.</p><p>Results matter, but so does the experience of getting there. Our goal is for you to feel informed, supported, and confident in the decisions ahead.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"reviews-themes\"><div class=\"reviews-themes-heading\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>What clients value</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">The qualities that<em>come up most often.</em></h2></div></div><div class=\"reviews-themes-list\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"reviews-theme\"><span class=\"reviews-theme-number\">01</span><div class=\"reviews-theme-content\"><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Clients consistently point to responsiveness and straightforward updates throughout the buying or selling process.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"reviews-theme\"><span class=\"reviews-theme-number\">02</span><div class=\"reviews-theme-content\"><h3>Local market knowledge</h3><p>Decades of Fox Cities experience help bring useful context to pricing, neighborhoods, timing, and negotiation.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"reviews-theme\"><span class=\"reviews-theme-number\">03</span><div class=\"reviews-theme-content\"><h3>A manageable process</h3><p>Real estate can be complex. Our goal is to make the next step understandable and keep the moving pieces organized.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"reviews-coming-soon\"><div class=\"reviews-coming-soon-visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"reviews-coming-soon-frame\"><span class=\"reviews-coming-soon-frame-index\">Stories / 01</span><span class=\"reviews-coming-soon-frame-mark\">★</span><span class=\"reviews-coming-soon-frame-label\">Fox Cities clients</span></div></div><div class=\"reviews-coming-soon-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow editorial-eyebrow--light\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Client stories coming soon</p><h2>Real experiences<em>deserve real words.</em></h2><p>We are preparing a selection of approved client stories to share here. Until then, our 525+ five-star review record remains a meaningful reflection of the trust clients have placed in our team.</p></div><div class=\"\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Talk with the Lathrop Team <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"editorial-closing-cta\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Your next move</p><h2>Let’s make the process<em>feel more manageable.</em></h2><p>Whether you are buying, selling, or thinking ahead, we are here to answer questions and help you create a clear plan.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation</a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p><strong>Oliver Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></p></address></div><div class=\"footer-map\"><div class=\"footer-map-header\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Office location</p><span>Appleton, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"footer-map-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2857.210069477556!2d-88.46770222396349!3d44.26449767107976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8803b7a5ba3b6f2d%3A0x6b0d2f80904d9e2f!2sKeller%20Williams%20Fox%20Cities!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1788252496599!5m2!1sen!2sin\" title=\"Keller Williams Fox Cities office location in Appleton, Wisconsin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0\" allowFullScreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div></div></div><div class=\"site-footer-compliance\"><div class=\"footer-kw\"><div class=\"footer-kw-heading\"><p>Keller Williams Fox Cities</p><img alt=\"Keller Williams Fox Cities\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"132\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"footer-kw-logo\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/PLACEHOLDER-KW-LOGO.jpg\"/></div><address>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI<br/>Each office is independently owned and operated.</address></div><div class=\"footer-compliance-marks\"><div class=\"footer-compliance-mark\"><img alt=\"Equal Housing Opportunity\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/PLACEHOLDER-EQUAL-HOUSING.jpg\"/><span>Equal Housing Opportunity</span></div><div class=\"foote